# ABP API Development

## Auto API Controllers
- Application services automatically become REST APIs
- HTTP method determined by naming convention
- Routes follow ABP conventions

## Key Features
- Automatic input validation
- Exception handling and error formatting
- Authorization integration
- Content negotiation
- API versioning support

## Client Proxies
- Generate C# clients: `abp generate-proxy -t csharp`
- Generate Angular proxies: `abp generate-proxy -t ng`
- Type-safe API consumption

## Standard APIs
- Application Configuration API
- Audit Logging API
- Permission Management API
